        "english": "Number two.",
        "chinese": "第二。"
    },
    {
        "start": 651.36,
        "end": 658.52,
        "english": "He claims his photographs prove once and for all that UFOs do exist.",
        "chinese": "他声称他的照片证明了UFO的存在。"
    },
    {
        "start": 658.52,
        "end": 661.92,
        "english": "Example three.",
        "chinese": "翻译成中文是："
    },
    {
        "start": 661.92,
        "end": 667.16,
        "english": "I told him once and for all that I don't want to be his girlfriend anymore.",
        "chinese": "我曾经告诉他，我不再是他女朋友。"
    },
    {
        "start": 667.16,
        "end": 668.66,
        "english": "Okay.",
        "chinese": "好的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 668.66,
        "end": 672.68,
        "english": "So now I think it's clear we've seen a lot of words.",
        "chinese": "所以现在我觉得我们已经看到很多词汇。"
    },
    {
        "start": 672.68,
        "end": 674.68,
        "english": "We've seen a lot of phrases.",
        "chinese": "我们已经看到很多表达。"
    },
    {
        "start": 674.68,
        "end": 684.68,
        "english": "Just listen to our dialogue one more time.",
        "chinese": "请听我们的一次对话。"
    },
    {
        "start": 684.68,
        "end": 694.16,
        "english": "They're breaking through.",
        "chinese": "他们正在突破。"
    },
    {
        "start": 694.16,
        "end": 701.4,
        "english": "Search for blasters to full power.",
        "chinese": "搜索所有射手的最高火力。"
    },
    {
        "start": 701.4,
        "end": 705.4,
        "english": "Excellent job.",
        "chinese": "好的工作。"
    },
    {
        "start": 705.4,
        "end": 706.4,
        "english": "Search the ship.",
        "chinese": "搜索船。"
    },
    {
        "start": 706.4,
        "end": 708.4,
        "english": "She's got to be in here somewhere.",
        "chinese": "她得在这里 somewhere。"
    },
    {
        "start": 708.4,
        "end": 713.4,
        "english": "Bring her to me.",
        "chinese": "请将她带到我。"
    },
    {
        "start": 713.4,
        "end": 717.4,
        "english": "Lord Hainer, we have a survivor here.",
        "chinese": "尊敬的先生，我们这里有一个幸存者。"
    },
    {
        "start": 717.4,
        "end": 719.4,
        "english": "Where is she?",
        "chinese": "在哪儿？"
    },
    {
        "start": 719.4,
        "end": 722.4,
        "english": "Don't make me destroy you.",
        "chinese": "不要让我破坏你。"
    },
    {
        "start": 722.4,
        "end": 725.4,
        "english": "Tell me where she is.",
        "chinese": "请告诉我她在哪里。"
    },
    {
        "start": 725.4,
        "end": 726.4,
        "english": "Not so fast.",
        "chinese": "不那么快。"
    },
    {
        "start": 726.4,
        "end": 729.4,
        "english": "She will no longer be your prisoner.",
        "chinese": "她将不再是你的囚犯。"
    },
    {
        "start": 729.4,
        "end": 733.68,
        "english": "It's time you and I settled this once and for all.",
        "chinese": "这是你和我解决这个问题的最好时机。"
    },
    {
        "start": 733.68,
        "end": 736.52,
        "english": "You are unwise and think you can defeat me.",
        "chinese": "您是愚蠢的，以为自己能打败我。"
    },
    {
        "start": 736.52,
        "end": 744.72,
        "english": "You know nothing of the power of your obscure side.",
        "chinese": "您不知道您的隐秘侧的力量。"
    },
    {
        "start": 745.72,
        "end": 751.72,
        "english": "So we will stop you.",
        "chinese": "所以我们将停止您。"
    },
    {
        "start": 751.72,
        "end": 762.72,
        "english": "Lord Hainer, we have an unidentified spacecraft taking off from the rear dock.",
        "chinese": "尊敬的阁下，我们有一艘未知的太空船正在从后货舱起飞。"
    },
    {
        "start": 762.72,
        "end": 765.72,
        "english": "They somehow managed to escape our treasure beam.",
        "chinese": "他们似乎成功地逃脱了我们的宝藏束。"
    },
    {
        "start": 765.72,
        "end": 767.72,
        "english": "After them.",
        "chinese": "之后。"
    },
    {
        "start": 767.72,
        "end": 769.72,
        "english": "They're accelerating towards the speed of light.",
        "chinese": "他们正接近光速。"
    },
    {
        "start": 769.72,
        "end": 774.72,
        "english": "We lost them sir.",
        "chinese": "我们丢失了他们。"
    },
    {
        "start": 786.72,
        "end": 789.72,
        "english": "Okay so are you a big sci-fi fan?",
        "chinese": "是的，你是一个大科幻迷吗？"
    },
    {
        "start": 789.72,
        "end": 792.72,
        "english": "I think as you can tell no.",
        "chinese": "我猜你可以说。"
    },
    {
        "start": 792.72,
        "end": 796.72,
        "english": "Actually I've seen some of the Star Wars movies but everyone that I've watched I've fallen asleep",
        "chinese": "实际上，我看过一些《星球大战》电影，但每个人我都睡着了。"
    },
    {
        "start": 796.72,
        "end": 797.72,
        "english": "in the middle of.",
        "chinese": "在中间。"
    },
    {
        "start": 797.72,
        "end": 798.72,
        "english": "Really?",
        "chinese": "真的？"
    },
    {
        "start": 798.72,
        "end": 802.72,
        "english": "Even in the movie theater I fell asleep in the movie theater watching Star Wars.",
        "chinese": "在电影院里，我甚至在看《星球大战》的时候睡着了。"
    },
    {
        "start": 802.72,
        "end": 803.72,
        "english": "Wow, was it too boring?",
        "chinese": "哇，太无聊了？"
    },
    {
        "start": 803.72,
        "end": 804.72,
        "english": "It was too boring.",
        "chinese": "太无聊了。"
    },
    {
        "start": 804.72,
        "end": 807.72,
        "english": "You're not really into the fantasy side.",
        "chinese": "您不是真正喜欢奇幻世界。"
    },
    {
        "start": 807.72,
        "end": 811.72,
        "english": "No, I just am the whole time sitting there going this cannot happen.",
        "chinese": "是的，我只是坐在那里，等待着这个不可能发生。"
    },
    {
        "start": 811.72,
        "end": 814.72,
        "english": "Well that's why it's called science fiction right?",
        "chinese": "那正是为什么叫科幻小说的原因吗？"
    },
    {
        "start": 814.72,
        "end": 815.72,
        "english": "Yes.",
        "chinese": "是。"
    },
    {
        "start": 815.72,
        "end": 821.72,
        "english": "But it is interesting to some people and well behind Star Wars there is a huge culture.",
        "chinese": "但是，对于一些人来说，这有趣且远远超出了《星球大战》。"
    },
    {
        "start": 821.72,
        "end": 826.72,
        "english": "Even some people know some of the languages or symbols that are used in it or the names",
        "chinese": "即使有些人知道它或它的某些语言或符号，或者名字。"
    },
    {
        "start": 826.72,
        "end": 829.72,
        "english": "of some of the robots and models of spacecraft.",
        "chinese": "一些航天器和模型的机器人。"
    },
    {
        "start": 829.72,
        "end": 833.72,
        "english": "Well maybe we'll have to come up with Star Wars Pod.",
        "chinese": "嗯，也许我们得找一个星球大战的太空舱。"
    },
    {
        "start": 833.72,
        "end": 834.72,
        "english": "Exactly.",
        "chinese": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”"
    },
    {
        "start": 834.72,
        "end": 836.72,
        "english": "Well that's all for today guys.",
        "chinese": "今天，我们说再见。"
    },
    {
        "start": 836.72,
        "end": 843.72,
        "english": "I hope you enjoyed our lesson and of course if you have questions or comments you can leave them in a comment section on our website, EnglishPod.com.",
        "chinese": "我希望大家今天的课程愉快，当然如果有问题或建议，请在我们的网站留言评论区留下。"
    },
    {
        "start": 843.72,
        "end": 846.72,
        "english": "Well thanks for listening you guys and until next time.",
        "chinese": "谢谢你们的聆听，你们好！直到下次。"
    },
    {
        "start": 846.72,
        "end": 847.72,
        "english": "Goodbye.",
        "chinese": "再见。"
    },
    {
        "start": 851.72,
        "end": 852.72,
        "english": "Bye.",
        "chinese": "再见。"
    }
